Add DragonFly BSD as a host platform, on top of the NetBSD patch of
bazel #31069.  DragonFly derives from FreeBSD 4 and keeps extattr(2) and
sysctlbyname(3), so unix_jni_bsd.cc takes the FreeBSD arm; it has no
libprocstat, so GetSelfPath asks the kernel with KERN_PROC_PATHNAME.  The
rest mirrors what #31069 does for NetBSD.  CI only: this has not been sent
upstream.

